    "title": "WeIND UP – Game Environment Project (Team Project)",
    "permalink": "https://www.artstation.com/artwork/rlxNzG",
    "published_at": "2026-05-21T21:46:35.784-05:00",
    "description": "<p>WeIND UP is a team-based cooperative puzzle game environment project currently in development.</p>\n\n<p>I translated 2D environment concept art into a fully realized 3D world in Unreal Engine, focusing on establishing mood, spatial composition, and visual coherence.\n<br />My work involved building the environment through mesh placement, prop creation, and lighting, ensuring atmospheric consistency and clear gameplay readability for cooperative puzzle interaction.</p>\n\n<p>Level design was handled by a dedicated level designer, and my responsibility was to execute and enhance the environment within the established layout through visual and atmospheric direction.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://x.com/Studio_Gravitia?s=20\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">https://x.com/Studio_Gravitia?s=20</a></p>",
